      "x": 13230,
      "y": 0,
      "theme": {
        "ds:Mode": "Dark"
      },
      "context": "/ (requireStaffSession + overview:read) — Operations centre for staff: what needs action first (reports, release review, failed tracks), then growth KPIs, pipeline, reports by type and the audit trail. Every tile is independent (1×1, 2×1, 2×2) so operators can later reorder, resize and hide tiles. Not-found is not drawn: unknown admin routes redirect to /. Login and /no-access are separate routes without the shell."
